T*
(           DATA PROCESSING AND SECURITY ADDENDUM TO THE) Tj
T*
(         CLOUD SERVICE AGREEMENT \(QH-HARBOR-2026-001\)) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(                    DOCUMENT ID: QH-HARBOR-2026-DPA) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Data Processing and Security Addendum \("Addendum"\) supplements the Cloud) Tj
T*
(Service Agreement between Quillhub Inc. \("Provider"\) and Harbor Retail Group) Tj
T*
(LLC \("Customer"\) dated September 15, 2026 \(Contract ID: QH-HARBOR-2026-001,) Tj
T*
(the "Agreement"\). This Addendum is incorporated into and forms part of the) Tj
T*
(Agreement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Capitalized terms not defined in this Addendum have the meanings given in the) Tj
T*
(Agreement or the Standard Terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In the event of a conflict between this Addendum and the Agreement \(including) Tj
T*
(the Standard Terms\), this Addendum controls with respect to data processing,) Tj
T*
(security, and breach notification obligations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1 ? SCOPE AND ROLES) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.1  This Addendum applies to the processing of Personal Data that Harbor) Tj
T*
(     Retail submits to or makes accessible through the Platform.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.2  For the purposes of Applicable Data Protection Laws:) Tj
T*
(     \(a\) Harbor Retail is the data controller \(or equivalent role\);) Tj
T*
(     \(b\) Quillhub is the data processor \(or equivalent role\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.3  Quillhub will process Personal Data only on documented instructions) Tj
T*
(     from Harbor Retail, including as set forth in this Addendum and the) Tj
T*
(     Agreement, unless required to do so by Applicable Laws. In such a case,) Tj
T*
(     Quillhub will inform Harbor Retail of that legal requirement before) Tj
T*
(     processing, unless Applicable Laws prohibit such notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2 ? DATA SECURITY) Tj
T*
(---------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1  Security Measures. Quillhub will implement and maintain appropriate) Tj
T*
(     technical and organizational measures to protect Personal Data against) Tj
T*
(     unauthorized or unlawful processing and against accidental loss,) Tj
T*
(     destruction, damage, theft, or disclosure. These measures include, at a) Tj
T*
(     minimum:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(     \(a\) Encryption of Personal Data at rest using AES-256 and in transit) Tj
T*
(         using TLS 1.2 or higher;) Tj
T*
(     \(b\) Access controls that limit access to Personal Data to authorized) Tj
T*
(         personnel on a need-to-know basis;) Tj
T*
(     \(c\) Regular testing and evaluation of the effectiveness of security) Tj
T*
(         measures;) Tj
T*
(     \(d\) Employee security training at least annually;) Tj
T*
(     \(e\) Secure disposal of media containing Personal Data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2  Access Logging. Quillhub will maintain access logs for systems that) Tj
T*
(     process Personal Data and will retain such logs for at least twelve \(12\)) Tj
T*
(     months.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.3  Vulnerability Management. Quillhub will perform vulnerability scans of) Tj
ET

