T*
(SECTION 3 ? DATA BREACH NOTIFICATION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.1  Notification Timing. If Quillhub becomes aware of a Data Breach \(as) Tj
T*
(     defined in Section 5.1 of the Agreement\), Quillhub will notify Harbor) Tj
T*
(     Retail within twenty-four \(24\) hours of becoming aware of the Data) Tj
T*
(     Breach. For the purposes of this Addendum, Quillhub "becomes aware" of) Tj
T*
(     a Data Breach at the point at which Quillhub has a reasonable degree of) Tj
T*
(     certainty that a security incident has resulted in unauthorized access) Tj
T*
(     to Personal Data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.2  Notification Contents. The notification will include, to the extent) Tj
T*
(     available: \(a\) the nature of the Data Breach; \(b\) the categories and) Tj
T*
(     approximate number of individuals and records affected; \(c\) the contact) Tj
T*
(     details of Quillhub's privacy officer or other contact; \(d\) the likely) Tj
T*
(     consequences; \(e\) the measures taken or proposed to address the breach) Tj
T*
(     and mitigate its effects.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.3  Cooperation. Quillhub will cooperate with Harbor Retail in investigating) Tj
T*
(     and remediating the Data Breach and will provide reasonable assistance) Tj
T*
(     in fulfilling Harbor Retail's obligations to notify individuals and) Tj
T*
(     regulatory authorities, at Quillhub's expense if the Data Breach was) Tj
T*
(     caused by Quillhub's failure to comply with this Addendum.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.4  Record Keeping. Quillhub will maintain a record of all Data Breaches,) Tj
T*
(     including the facts relating to the breach, its effects, and the) Tj
T*
(     remedial action taken.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 4 ? SUBPROCESSORS) Tj
T*
(---------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.1  Authorization. Harbor Retail grants Quillhub general authorization to) Tj
T*
(     engage subprocessors to process Personal Data, subject to the) Tj
T*
(     requirements in this Section 4.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.2  Current Subprocessors. As of the Effective Date, the following) Tj
T*
(     subprocessors are authorized:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(       Subprocessor          Service                   Location) Tj
T*
(       -------------------   -----------------------   ---------------) Tj
T*
(       StratoNode Inc.       Cloud infrastructure      United States) Tj
T*
(       SendGrid Inc.         Transactional email       United States) Tj
T*
(       Logfire Analytics     Usage analytics            United States) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.3  New Subprocessors. Quillhub will notify Harbor Retail of any new) Tj
T*
(     subprocessor at least thirty \(30\) days before the new subprocessor) Tj
T*
(     begins processing Personal Data. The notification will include the) Tj
T*
(     subprocessor's name, the processing activities, and the location of) Tj
T*
(     processing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.4  Objection. Harbor Retail may object to a new subprocessor in writing) Tj
T*
(     within fifteen \(15\) days of receiving notice. If Harbor Retail objects) Tj
T*
(     on reasonable data-protection grounds and Quillhub cannot address the) Tj
T*
(     objection within thirty \(30\) days, Harbor Retail may terminate this) Tj
T*
(     Addendum and the Agreement upon written notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 5 ? DATA RETENTION AND DELETION) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------) Tj
ET

