T*
(5.1  Upon termination or expiration of the Agreement, Quillhub will, at) Tj
T*
(     Harbor Retail's election, delete or return all Personal Data within) Tj
T*
(     sixty \(60\) days. Quillhub will certify in writing that deletion has) Tj
T*
(     been completed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.2  Quillhub may retain Personal Data to the extent required by Applicable) Tj
T*
(     Laws, provided that Quillhub will \(a\) limit such retention to the) Tj
T*
(     minimum necessary; \(b\) continue to protect the retained data in) Tj
T*
(     accordance with this Addendum; and \(c\) delete the retained data when) Tj
T*
(     the legal obligation has been fulfilled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 6 ? AUDITS) Tj
T*
(--------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1  Quillhub will make available to Harbor Retail, upon reasonable request) Tj
T*
(     and at least once per year, information necessary to demonstrate) Tj
T*
(     compliance with this Addendum. This may include third-party audit) Tj
T*
(     reports \(e.g., SOC 2 Type II\), security certifications, or summaries) Tj
T*
(     of internal assessments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2  Harbor Retail may, upon sixty \(60\) days' written notice, conduct or) Tj
T*
(     commission an audit of Quillhub's data-processing activities, limited) Tj
T*
(     to once per twelve-month period unless a Data Breach has occurred.) Tj
T*
(     Quillhub will cooperate with the audit and provide reasonable access) Tj
T*
(     to relevant facilities, systems, and personnel.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 7 ? INTERNATIONAL TRANSFERS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.1  Quillhub will not transfer Personal Data outside the United States) Tj
T*
(     without Harbor Retail's prior written consent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.2  If a transfer outside the United States is authorized, Quillhub will) Tj
T*
(     ensure that appropriate safeguards are in place as required by) Tj
T*
(     Applicable Data Protection Laws, including standard contractual clauses) Tj
T*
(     or other approved transfer mechanisms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 8 ? LIABILITY) Tj
T*
(-----------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.1  Quillhub's liability for breaches of this Addendum will be subject to) Tj
T*
(     the limitation of liability provisions in the Agreement, except that) Tj
T*
(     Data Breach obligations under Section 3 of this Addendum are Unlimited) Tj
T*
(     Claims as specified in Section J of the Cover Page.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
